{
  "_comment": [
    "Checker-set overlay: the stdlib allowlist repair.",
    "",
    "The shipped allowlist omits ten module names that are in the Python",
    "standard library and that leaves in this corpus genuinely import:",
    "__future__ (791 files), importlib (15), cmath (14), doctest (7),",
    "fractions (7), calendar (6), ast (3), unicodedata, zlib and hmac.",
    "",
    "This is the motivating case for regrade. The evidence did not change;",
    "the rule was wrong. Applying this overlay re-decides every issued",
    "record without re-running one test."
  ],
  "label": "allowlist-repair-2026-09-19",
